{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead the forgotten. Fight the impossible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Men of War: Condemned Heroes</i> is a standalone entry in the acclaimed real-time tactics series, delivering one of the most intense and uncompromising portrayals of World War II. Command a Soviet penal battalion formed under the infamous Order 227 \u2013 units sent into the deadliest missions with no room for retreat or mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/ad656fbb19cccdc89a517628a95cf353.poster.avif?t=1773656451\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/ad656fbb19cccdc89a517628a95cf353.webm?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/ad656fbb19cccdc89a517628a95cf353.mp4?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on real historical accounts and veterans\u2019 testimonies, the game follows condemned soldiers through four connected campaigns spanning <strong>1942\u20131945</strong> \u2013 from the desperate defenses in Volhynia and Poland to the final assault on Germany. Every mission demands precision, courage, and sacrifice, blending large-scale battlefield tactics with brutal, up-close skirmishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/dcfe2c30a4a796ea58c2321cf6992076.poster.avif?t=1773656451\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/dcfe2c30a4a796ea58c2321cf6992076.webm?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/dcfe2c30a4a796ea58c2321cf6992076.mp4?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on an enhanced <strong>GEM engine</strong>, <i>Condemned Heroes</i> introduces improved physics, visuals, and animation, making the chaos and realism of war more visceral than ever. Its unforgiving design and historical authenticity create a raw, cinematic experience that pushes players to lead with strategy and survive against impossible odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Men of War: Condemned Heroes</i> is a brutal, story-driven strategy experience about redemption, survival, and the human cost of war.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standalone campaign experience</strong> \u2013 no prior Men of War titles required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four story-driven campaigns (1942\u20131945)</strong> \u2013 follow the journey of a Soviet penal unit through the Eastern Front.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based on real events</strong> \u2013 inspired by true accounts and veterans\u2019 stories of the Red Army\u2019s penal battalions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced GEM engine</strong> \u2013 improved physics, destruction, animations, and visual fidelity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Eastern Front atmosphere</strong> \u2013 from uniforms and weapons to historically accurate environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical realism and challenge</strong> \u2013 every decision, every mistake, and every life matters.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Baptism by Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/204860/0f39d8eabe49cc9faa43f0a5ee25e3e8e955cfe4.jpg"},{"name":"Soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/204860/c3fc9dfe4cc8ab3bc47f98c51142b36ed823e2a6.jpg"},{"name":"Assist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/204860/569de873a5612224e8e29a0e7372937f90165b6b.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/204860/b298332e23ace98dea7688ec75003bc6d398703b.jpg"},{"name":"Impetuous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/204860/322ed281cef18c4f81fbf2456ef3af8daee5528f.jpg"},{"name":"Hard Day Indeed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/204860/7a473004b8764717cc22952de3a60b97ec2e5681.jpg"},{"name":"Valourous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/204860/8288025b97a07d36834985a7b1dbbbc8ae052c09.jpg"},{"name":"Tactician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/204860/cb4f0eb86beb16081be152d3e4fa4aeaaa39e1b4.jpg"},{"name":"For Courage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/204860/4a945f3c6de19bfec5028426c989202428a204ca.jpg"},{"name":"Encirclement","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/204860/722fff116f92ae8bbd3fb02324a62efd1d62be96.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/204860?t=1773656451","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/226ecf2f1537b4db5885708d2733d369e347ba2f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773656451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/71fee88235f32ce78bb8bf8b2e22b8c0bff75ace/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773656451","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/71fee88235f32ce78bb8bf8b2e22b8c0bff75ace/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773656451","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Men of War II Available Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead the forgotten. Fight the impossible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Men of War: Condemned Heroes</i> is a standalone entry in the acclaimed real-time tactics series, delivering one of the most intense and uncompromising portrayals of World War II. Command a Soviet penal battalion formed under the infamous Order 227 \u2013 units sent into the deadliest missions with no room for retreat or mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/ad656fbb19cccdc89a517628a95cf353.poster.avif?t=1773656451\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/ad656fbb19cccdc89a517628a95cf353.webm?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/ad656fbb19cccdc89a517628a95cf353.mp4?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on real historical accounts and veterans\u2019 testimonies, the game follows condemned soldiers through four connected campaigns spanning <strong>1942\u20131945</strong> \u2013 from the desperate defenses in Volhynia and Poland to the final assault on Germany. Every mission demands precision, courage, and sacrifice, blending large-scale battlefield tactics with brutal, up-close skirmishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/dcfe2c30a4a796ea58c2321cf6992076.poster.avif?t=1773656451\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/dcfe2c30a4a796ea58c2321cf6992076.webm?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/dcfe2c30a4a796ea58c2321cf6992076.mp4?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on an enhanced <strong>GEM engine</strong>, <i>Condemned Heroes</i> introduces improved physics, visuals, and animation, making the chaos and realism of war more visceral than ever. Its unforgiving design and historical authenticity create a raw, cinematic experience that pushes players to lead with strategy and survive against impossible odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Men of War: Condemned Heroes</i> is a brutal, story-driven strategy experience about redemption, survival, and the human cost of war.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standalone campaign experience</strong> \u2013 no prior Men of War titles required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four story-driven campaigns (1942\u20131945)</strong> \u2013 follow the journey of a Soviet penal unit through the Eastern Front.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based on real events</strong> \u2013 inspired by true accounts and veterans\u2019 stories of the Red Army\u2019s penal battalions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced GEM engine</strong> \u2013 improved physics, destruction, animations, and visual fidelity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Eastern Front atmosphere</strong> \u2013 from uniforms and weapons to historically accurate environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical realism and challenge</strong> \u2013 every decision, every mistake, and every life matters.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Fulqrum Publishing"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/9b905a59a7662cc1bc8fbf27a816101028604d9b/header.jpg?t=1773656451","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2012 Fulqrum Publishing Ltd. All rights reserved. \u00a9 2012 This product contains software technology licensed by Best Way. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"metacritic":{"score":57,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/men-of-war-condemned-heroes?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/204860/2039547889/01e64d0d1170e806ff4b87b41f4b0de531542532/1765205801/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765276705","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/204860/2039547889/01e64d0d1170e806ff4b87b41f4b0de531542532/1765205801/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765276705","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/204860/2039547889/01e64d0d1170e806ff4b87b41f4b0de531542532/1765205801/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765276705","id":257245195,"name":"Condemned Heroes","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257245195/840fa6852315fdfd0c4941d53eb3194cb222a757/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765276705"}],"name":"Men of War: Condemned Heroes","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Men of War: Condemned Heroes - $7.99 USD","packageid":14032,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":799}],"title":"Bu